<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Vinofilo</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/</link><description>Vinofilo：意大利葡萄酒的故事、产区与工艺。品种、产区、酿造与侍酒，有观点地讲述。</description><language>zh</language><atom:link href="https://vinofilo.com/zh/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>意大利伟大的甜酒：从阿尔卑斯到岛屿的一张地图</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/yidali-tianjiu-zhinan-ditu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/yidali-tianjiu-zhinan-ditu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>风干、贵腐、晚收与加强酒：一份从北到南的意大利甜酒指南，从Recioto一直走到Moscato di Noto。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-dolci-italiani.jpg?v=6a391e49" length="383609" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-dolci-italiani.jpg?v=6a391e49" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Oltrepò Pavese：米兰视而不见的葡萄园</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/oltrepo-pavese-milan-putaoyuan-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/oltrepo-pavese-milan-putaoyuan-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>米兰以南是伦巴第最大的葡萄园，出产Bonarda、Buttafuoco、Pinot Nero和气泡酒。为什么很少有人提起它，它又在如何改变。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/oltrepo-pavese-vigneto-di-milano.jpg?v=0f633010" length="280362" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/oltrepo-pavese-vigneto-di-milano.jpg?v=0f633010" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>茄子帕尔玛焗（parmigiana）配什么酒：油炸、烤制还是清淡版</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/qiezi-parmigiana-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/qiezi-parmigiana-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><