nk="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.12/qiancengmian-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>博洛尼亚肉酱、罗勒青酱、蘑菇、素食，还是那不勒斯狂欢节版本：从Sangiovese、Lambrusco到Barbera，每一种千层面该配哪一款酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-le-lasagne.jpg?v=5ca2a482" length="213934" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-le-lasagne.jpg?v=5ca2a482" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Cirò与Gaglioppo：带着古意的卡拉布里亚葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.12/ciro-gaglioppo-kalabulia-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.12/ciro-gaglioppo-kalabulia-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从克里米萨的神话，到改变航向的年轻酿酒人：Cirò、Gaglioppo，以及一个不再为自己道歉的卡拉布里亚葡萄酒产区。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/ciro-gaglioppo-calabria.jpg?v=94c193c7" length="283096" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/ciro-gaglioppo-calabria.jpg?v=94c193c7" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>葡萄酒是怎么酿的？红葡萄酒与白葡萄酒，从葡萄园到酒瓶</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.12/putaojiu-shi-zenme-niang-de/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.12/putaojiu-shi-zenme-niang-de/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>采收、破碎、发酵、浸渍与陈酿：葡萄酒是如何酿成的，红、白、桃红有什么不同，法律又是怎么规定的。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/come-si-fa-il-vino.jpg?v=1d830656" length="302238" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/come-si-fa-il-vino.jpg?v=1d830656" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>bollito和brasato配什么酒？冬日肉菜的合适红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.11/bollito-brasato-pei-shenme-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.11/bollito-brasato-pei-shenme-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>皮埃蒙特与伦巴第的什锦水煮肉及其酱汁、Barolo红酒焖牛肉、cotechino配扁豆。哪款酒该放进锅里，哪款该倒进杯里。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-bollito-e-brasato.jpg?v=3c0dd393" length="252291" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-bollito-e-brasato.jpg?v=3c0dd393" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Cesanese：被罗马遗忘的拉齐奥红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.11/cesanese-lazio-hongputao-piglio/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.11/cesanese-lazio-hongputao-piglio/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从Piglio DOCG到奥莱瓦诺罗马诺与阿菲莱，Cesanese的历史与复兴：拉齐奥最重要的红葡萄，至今喝的人仍然太少。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cesanese-il-rosso-del-lazio.jpg?v=9febfe4c" length="276278" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cesanese-il-rosso-del-lazio.jpg?v=9febfe4c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>做菜用什么酒？该选哪一款，以及酒精到底还剩多少</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.10/zuocai-yong-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.10/zuocai-yong-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>白酒还是红酒，烹香（sfumare）、炖肉、烩饭与甜点：厨房里该用哪款酒，以及烹煮之后酒精究竟还剩多少。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-per-cucinare.jpg?v=a69a98af" length="305711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-per-cucinare.jpg?v=a69a98af" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Ruchè：被一位本堂神父从遗忘中救回的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.10/ruche-castagnole-monferrato-shenfu-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.10/ruche-castagnole-monferrato-shenfu-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Ruchè di Castagnole Monferrato，2010年起为DOCG：Giacomo Cauda神父的故事、产区的七个市镇，以及玫瑰、紫罗兰与香料的轮廓。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/ruche-di-castagnole-monferrato.jpg?v=c5e9c008" length="337035" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/ruche-di-castagnole-monferrato.jpg?v=c5e9c008" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>一杯葡萄酒有多少热量？算一算就知道</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.09/putaojiu-reliang-yibei-duoshao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.09/putaojiu-reliang-yibei-duoshao/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>葡萄酒的热量从何而来，酒精与糖各占多少，按酒款算出的参考表，以及2023年12月起酒标上必须标注什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/calorie-del-vino.jpg?v=8f139d57" length="280128" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/calorie-del-vino.jpg?v=8f139d57" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>意大利的Pinot Nero：向勃艮第发起的挑战</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.09/yidali-pinot-nero-tiaozhan-bogendi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.09/yidali-pinot-nero-tiaozhan-bogendi/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从Alto Adige到Oltrepò，从特伦蒂诺到弗留利：为什么Pinot Nero是最难驯服的品种，以及意大利在哪里做到了。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pinot-nero-in-italia.jpg?v=b9c1fd31" length="375269" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pinot-nero-in-italia.jpg?v=b9c1fd31" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>15欧元以下最好的起泡酒，一个产区一个产区地挑</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.08/15-ouyuan-yixia-zuihao-de-qipaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.08/15-ouyuan-yixia-zuihao-de-qipaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>Prosecco Superiore、Trento DOC、Crémant、Cava、Oltrepò、Lambrusco和Asti：想在15欧元以下喝得好，酒标上该找什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bollicine-sotto-15-euro.jpg?v=3e371071" length="244959" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bollicine-sotto-15-euro.jpg?v=3e371071" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>瓦莱达奥斯塔：抬头种出来的山地葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.08/wa-lai-da-aosita-shandi-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.08/wa-lai-da-aosita-shandi-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Prié Blanc、Petit Rouge、Fumin、Cornalin与Petite Arvine：瓦莱达奥斯塔的英雄式葡萄种植，高海拔的葡萄园与唯一的大区DOC。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/valle-d-aosta-vini-di-montagna.jpg?v=b7c30c1e" length="368068" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/valle-d-aosta-vini-di-montagna.jpg?v=b7c30c1e" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>佛罗伦萨牛排配什么酒？为什么几乎总是Sangiovese</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.07/folaluolunsa-niupai-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.07/folaluolunsa-niupai-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>Chianti Classico、Rosso di Montalcino、Brunello还是Nobile？如何为佛罗伦萨T骨牛排选酒，以及在托斯卡纳之外喝什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-fiorentina.jpg?v=38fded62" length="315053" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-fiorentina.jpg?v=38fded62" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Teroldego Rotaliano：诞生在平原上的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.07/teroldego-rotaliano-pingyuan-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.07/teroldego-rotaliano-pingyuan-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>一款长在谷底而非山坡上的特伦蒂诺红酒：Teroldego Rotaliano的历史、DOC产区规定、显赫的亲戚（包括Syrah）与风格。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/teroldego-rotaliano.jpg?v=6240e98b" length="425526" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/teroldego-rotaliano.jpg?v=6240e98b" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>未开封的葡萄酒会过期吗？酒标没告诉你的事</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.06/putaojiu-weikaifeng-guoqi-ma/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.06/putaojiu-weikaifeng-guoqi-ma/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>为什么葡萄酒没有保质期，哪些酒要趁年轻喝，哪些能放上多年，以及如何判断一瓶未开封的酒是否已经走样。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-bottiglia-chiusa-scade.jpg?v=f91d1991" length="223457" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-bottiglia-chiusa-scade.jpg?v=f91d1991" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Sagrantino di Montefalco：会咬人、也愿意等的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.06/sagrantino-montefalco-yaoren-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.06/sagrantino-montefalco-yaoren-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从节庆时的风干甜酒，到法定陈酿37个月的干型红酒，Sagrantino di Montefalco的历史、DOCG产区规定，以及这款意大利单宁最重的红酒的性格。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sagrantino-di-montefalco.jpg?v=e4c4b039" length="378841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sagrantino-di-montefalco.jpg?v=e4c4b039" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Pantelleria：葡萄藤躲着风生长，酿出Passito</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.05/pantelleria-zibibbo-passito-guanmushi-putaoshu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.05/pantelleria-zibibbo-passito-guanmushi-putaoshu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Zibibbo、列入联合国教科文组织遗产的灌木式葡萄树、凹坑、干砌石墙和日晒风干：为什么Passito di Pantelleria是一款要花力气的酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pantelleria-zibibbo-passito.jpg?v=c77ec304" length="338415" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pantelleria-zibibbo-passito.jpg?v=c77ec304" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Pecorino与Passerina：从无到有重归的白葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.05/pecorino-passerina-offida-docg-baiputao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.05/pecorino-passerina-offida-docg-baiputao/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>两种几近绝迹的葡萄，如今是Offida DOCG的主角。马尔凯与阿布鲁佐的重新发现，以及关于它们名字的传说，需谨慎对待。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pecorino-e-passerina.jpg?v=d54dc0dd" length="218964" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pecorino-e-passerina.jpg?v=d54dc0dd" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2026年博若莱新酒：11月19日，争议最大的葡萄酒又来了</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.04/2026-bojolai-xinjiu-11yue19ri/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.04/2026-bojolai-xinjiu-11yue19ri/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 07:0