2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>预约、要多久、品鉴要不要付费、吐不吐酒、买不买：参观酒庄的不成文规矩（以及成文的规矩）。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/visitare-una-cantina.jpg?v=2e61873a" length="399802" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/visitare-una-cantina.jpg?v=2e61873a" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>鱼配什么酒？白葡萄酒不是规矩，只是习惯</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.02/yu-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.02/yu-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>生食、烤箱、烧烤、炖煮和青背鱼，鱼到底该配什么酒？从紧致的白酒到桃红和轻盈的红酒，一次说清。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-il-pesce.jpg?v=f88d1c06" length="266917" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-il-pesce.jpg?v=f88d1c06" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>变暖时代的葡萄酒：采收提前，葡萄园步步登高</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.02/qihou-bianhua-putaojiu-caishou-haiba/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.02/qihou-bianhua-putaojiu-caishou-haiba/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>采收提前、海拔一千米的葡萄园、英国起泡酒与PIWI抗病品种。气候变化正在如何改写葡萄酒的地理与风格。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cambiamento-climatico-e-vino.jpg?v=073c3507" length="334065" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cambiamento-climatico-e-vino.jpg?v=073c3507" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Valpolicella：四款酒（外加一款）的山谷，从Classico到Amarone</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/valpolicella-sikuan-jiu-de-shangu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/valpolicella-sikuan-jiu-de-shangu/</guid><pubDat