xili-baipu-tao-grillo-catarratto/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/xixili-baipu-tao-grillo-catarratto/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>四种白葡萄，带你认识Marsala与埃特纳之外的西西里：盐田、海风，以及在这样炎热的岛上很少有人料到的酸度。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/grillo-catarratto-bianchi-siciliani.jpg?v=dffb1f92" length="207534" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/grillo-catarratto-bianchi-siciliani.jpg?v=dffb1f92" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>没有开瓶器怎么办？不受伤也能开酒的方法</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/meiyou-kaipingqi-zenme-kai-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/meiyou-kaipingqi-zenme-kai-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>把软木塞推进瓶里，用螺丝和钳子，或者拿鞋子撞墙：哪些办法管用，哪些千万别试，外加一段开瓶器的小历史。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aprire-vino-senza-cavatappi.jpg?v=bb3e03b6" length="376075" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aprire-vino-senza-cavatappi.jpg?v=bb3e03b6" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Nero d&#x27;Avola：从调配用酒到西西里的象征</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/nero-davola-xixili-de-xiangzheng/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/nero-davola-xixili-de-xiangzheng/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>几十年来，南方把它运往北方，给别的酒添色。如今Nero d&#x27;Avola有了自己的产区、自己的分区，终于也有了自己的面孔。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nero-d-avola-oltre-il-cliche.jpg?v=c4a1f322" length="279039" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nero-d-avola-oltre-il-cliche.jpg?v=c4a1f322" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>10欧元以下的好白葡萄酒，到底该去哪里找</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.29/10-ouyuan-yixia-hao-baiputaojiu-zenme-zhao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.29/10-ouyuan-yixia-hao-baiputaojiu-zenme-zhao/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>10欧元以下意大利白葡萄酒选购指南：在这个价位上物超所值的产区与类型。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bianchi-sotto-10-euro.jpg?v=a29b687c" length="180474" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bianchi-sotto-10-euro.jpg?v=a29b687c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Gavi：眺望大海的皮埃蒙特白酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.29/gavi-cortese-pimengte-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.29/gavi-cortese-pimengte-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Cortese，1998年起升为DOCG，Gavi di Gavi与三种土壤。一款处在皮埃蒙特与利古里亚交界的白酒，如何成为出口最多的白酒之一。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/gavi-cortese-bianco-piemonte.jpg?v=9174a3de" length="272307" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/gavi-cortese-bianco-piemonte.jpg?v=9174a3de" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2026年Tempranillo国际日：11月12日，开瓶西班牙</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.28/tempranillo-guoji-ri-2026-11-12/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.28/tempranillo-guoji-ri-2026-11-12/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>11月12日星期四是国际Tempranillo日：Rioja、Ribera del Duero、Toro和葡萄牙，该开哪一瓶，又该配什么菜。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/tempranillo-day-12-novembre-2026.jpg?v=3e347bfd" length="307894" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/tempranillo-day-12-novembre-2026.jpg?v=3e347bfd" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>根瘤蚜：改写了葡萄酒版图的小虫</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.28/genliuya-gaixie-putaojiu-ditu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.28/genliuya-gaixie-putaojiu-ditu/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>从美洲到法国，再到意大利：一只一毫米长的昆虫如何摧毁了欧洲的葡萄园，以及为什么今天几乎每一株葡萄藤都长着美洲的根。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fillossera-insetto-che-cambio-il-vino.jpg?v=54abd1f9" length="426367" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fillossera-insetto-che-cambio-il-vino.jpg?v=54abd1f9" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>圣马丁节：11月11日，每一桶葡萄汁都变成酒的日子</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.27/shengmading-jie-11yue-11ri-xinjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.27/shengmading-jie-11yue-11ri-xinjiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>11月11日圣马丁节：节日的由来、圣马丁的夏天、各地用新酒庆祝的传统，以及那天该开什么酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/san-martino-11-novembre-vino-nuovo.jpg?v=977e2396" length="192079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/san-martino-11-novembre-vino-nuovo.jpg?v=977e2396" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>南瓜配什么酒？秋天最狡猾的搭配</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.27/nangua-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.27/nangua-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>烩饭、曼托瓦南瓜馅饺、浓汤或烤南瓜：当南瓜的甜味让酒杯失衡时，该选什么酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-zucca.jpg?v=ec4f0e2c" length="352447" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-zucca.jpg?v=ec4f0e2c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>烟、油脂与单宁：烧烤该开什么酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.26/shaokao-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.26/shaokao-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>肋排、佛罗伦萨牛排、羊肉、鸡肉、蔬菜和炭烤鱼：选哪款意大利酒，为什么管用，以及用什么温度上桌。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-per-la-grigliata.jpg?v=88eb51d1" length="216811" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-per-la-grigliata.jpg?v=88eb51d1" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Franciacorta对Trento DOC：湖与山的较量</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.26/franciacorta-trento-doc-hu-yu-shan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.26/franciacorta-trento-doc-hu-yu-shan/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>意大利两大传统法起泡酒之都的比较：湖畔与山地的气候、产区规章、Satèn与Riserva。杯中到底有什么不同。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/franciacorta-e-trento-doc.jpg?v=34c1ccb0" length="245175" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/franciacorta-e-trento-doc.jpg?v=34c1ccb0" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>英国和美国网上买酒：大型酒商指南</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.26/yingguo-meiguo-wangshang-mai-jiu-zhinan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.26/yingguo-meiguo-wangshang-mai-jiu-zhinan/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>Majestic、The Wine Society、Naked Wines、Berry Bros.、Wine.com、Total Wine和Wine Access：如果你住在意大利，该怎么看它们，它们真正有什么用。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/comprare-vino-online-regno-unito-stati-uniti.jpg?v=ebe006e6" length="269920" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/comprare-vino-online-regno-unito-stati-uniti.jpg?v=ebe006e6" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>carbonara、amatriciana与cacio e pepe配什么酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.25/carbonara-amatriciana-cacio-e-pepe-pei-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.25/carbonara-amatriciana-cacio-e-pepe-pei-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>guanciale、pecorino和黑胡椒说了算。罗马三大经典面食该配哪款酒，从Cesanese到Frascati，以及为什么行得通。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-carbonara-amatriciana-cacio-e-pepe.jpg?v=0b9f754a" length="295419" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-carbonara-amatriciana-cacio-e-pepe.jpg?v=0b9f754a" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Lugana：征服海外的加尔达湖白葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.25/lugana-turbiana-jiaerda-hu-bai-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.25/lugana-turbiana-jiaerda-hu-bai-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Turbiana葡萄、黏土土壤，以及横跨伦巴第与威内托的DOC：为什么Lugana在海外如此受欢迎，又该如何读懂它的不同类型。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lugana-turbiana-lago-di-garda.jpg?v=23f3eae3" length="223449" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lugana-turbiana-lago-di-garda.jpg?v=23f3eae3" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>烩饭配什么酒？锅里的酒，决定杯中的酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/huifan-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/huifan-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>米兰式、巴罗洛、阿马罗尼、海鲜或红菊苣烩饭：从倒进锅里的那瓶酒出发，看看该怎样为烩饭选酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-il-risotto.jpg?v=e24d094d" length="207154" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-il-risotto.jpg?v=e24d094d" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Soave：不再甘当配角的白葡萄酒，从Classico到Recioto</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/soave-garganega-zhengming/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/soave-garganega-zhengming/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从超市货架上的杯中酒，到火山岩与石灰岩土壤上的Garganega：为什么Soave值得重新发现，从Classico一直到Recioto。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/soave-garganega-riscatto.jpg?v=46f2f4d2" length="333568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/soave-garganega-riscatto.jpg?v=46f2f4d2" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>法国和德国网上买酒：最大的线上酒铺指南</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/faguo-deguo-wangshang-mai-jiu-zhinan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/faguo-deguo-wangshang-mai-jiu-zhinan/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>Vinatis、Millésima、Twil、iDealwine、Hawesko、Vinello、Belvini：它们是谁、运费多少，以及从国外买酒时消费税该知道什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/comprare-vino-online-francia-germania.jpg?v=85ba0a97" length="247288" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/comprare-vino-online-francia-germania.jpg?v=85ba0a97" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Italia Nostra 红色名单：我们可能失去的美</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/hongse-mingdan-italia-nostra-putaojiu-jingguan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.24/hongse-mingdan-italia-nostra-putaojiu-jingguan/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>濒危文化遗产的红色名单现已上线。它为何也与爱酒之人有关：葡萄酒正诞生于这片需要守护的风景。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lista-rossa-italia-nostra-paesaggi-del-vino.jpg?v=e0da5443" length="441290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lista-rossa-italia-nostra-paesaggi-del-vino.jpg?v=e0da5443" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>11月7日Merlot Day：为被《Sideways》嘲弄的葡萄正名</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.23/merlot-day-11yue-7ri-meiluo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.23/merlot-day-11yue-7ri-meiluo/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>11月7日是国际Merlot日：从波美侯（Pomerol）到提契诺，途经弗留利与波格利，说说它的历史，以及那天该开哪一瓶。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/merlot-day-7-novembre-2026.jpg?v=cf66be4d" length="324351" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/merlot-day-7-novembre-2026.jpg?v=cf66be4d" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Marsala：被我们关进厨房的意大利伟大葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.23/marsala-bei-yiwang-de-weida-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.23/marsala-bei-yiwang-de-weida-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从John Woodhouse到Florio，从蛋黄Marsala到重生：这款意大利最被低估的加强酒的历史、类别与翻身之路。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/marsala-il-grande-dimenticato.jpg?v=1f09bd1d" length="253384" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/marsala-il-grande-dimenticato.jpg?v=1f09bd1d" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Decanter顶级佳酿盛会：伦敦两天开启一千款葡萄酒</title><link>